 "comment": "The board and evidence facts of a typed session that no image carries: the board prefix, the thermal and CPU grant records and, for an image with the NPU service, the NPU authority words. tools/session.py build adds what the image determines (image identity, manifest digest, epoch, generation, lease, NPU catalogue, client model, pool and declaration, the thermal record size) and refuses a field that this file and the image leave open. Every 32-byte value is an evidence digest or approval digest copied from the reviewed session below; this file establishes none of the facts they identify.",
 "profiles_comment": {
  "control": "for an OS image without the NPU service. Source: the reviewed control session ~/.cache/sunstoneos/evidence/wdt-breadcrumbs-1031/control/offline-proof/prepared/board/session-template.bin (SHA-256 777113d67f5e9da2b8230ef0b3324df4e9bf8b8d70b44af817e013cde828bed7), the default template of tools/board_images.py.",
